            <value form="markdown">Enya</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt1-label">
            <value>Yayi</value>
            <value form="markdown">Yayi</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-label">
            <value>Kasi mungandiphalirako chinthu chimoza icho muzi winu ukadumura panji kuzomerezgana pa wungano wa pafupi apa?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kasi mungandiphalirako chinthu chimoza icho muzi winu ukadumura panji kuzomerezgana pa wungano wa pafupi apa?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-opt0-label">
            <value>Wayowoyapo chinthu icho chikadumulika</value>
            <value form="markdown">Wayowoyapo chinthu icho chikadumulika</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-opt1-label">
            <value>Wandayowoye chilichose</value>
            <value form="markdown">Wandayowoye chilichose</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-decision_named-label">
            <value>Kasi wayowoya chinthu wuli icho chikadumulika?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kasi wayowoya chinthu wuli icho chikadumulika?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-decision_named-constraintMsg">
            <value>Lembani malembo 100 panji ghachoko.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Lembani malembo 100 panji ghachoko.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-spoke_this_month-label">
            <value>Kasi mukayowoyapo pa wungano wa muzi mwezi uno?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kasi mukayowoyapo pa wungano wa muzi mwezi uno?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-about_the_meetings-spoke_this_month-opt2-label">
            <value>Nkhumanya makora yayi</value>
            <value form="markdown">Nkhumanya makora yayi</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-recommendation-label">
            <value>Kuchiska ŵanyake</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kuchiska ŵanyake</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-recommendation-nps-label">
            <value>Kufuma pa 0 mpaka 10, kasi mungachiska muzi unyake kuti unjire mu FCAP chomene wuli?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kufuma pa 0 mpaka 10, kasi mungachiska muzi unyake kuti unjire mu FCAP chomene wuli?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-recommendation-nps-constraintMsg">
            <value>Lembani nambala kufuma pa 0 mpaka 10.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Lembani nambala kufuma pa 0 mpaka 10.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-recommendation-nps_probe-label">
            <value>Kasi chifukwa chikuru cha nambala iyo mwapeleka ni vichi?</value>
            <value form="markdown">Kasi chifukwa chikuru cha nambala iyo mwapeleka ni vichi?</value>
          </text>
          <text id="participants-recommendation-nps_probe-constraintMsg">
            <value>Lembani malembo 200 panji ghachoko.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Lembani malembo 200 panji ghachoko.</value>
          </text>
          <text id="feedback_end-label">
            <value>Yewo. Tumizgani fomu pamanyuma pa kufumba ŵanthu wose 8.</value>
            <value form="markdown">Yewo. Tumizgani fomu pamanyuma pa kufumba ŵanthu wose 8.</value>
          </text>
        </translation>
      </itext>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/@date_modified" type="xsd:dateTime" calculate="/data/meta/timeEnd"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/@user_id" calculate="/data/meta/userID"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/@case_id" calculate="instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/feedback_date" calculate="/data/feedback_date_value" relevant="count(/data/feedback_date_value) &gt; 0"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/case/update/feedback_done" calculate="/data/feedback_done_value" relevant="count(/data/feedback_done_value) &gt; 0"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/feedback_done_value" value="instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id=instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/feedback_done" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/feedback_date_value" value="instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id=instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/feedback_date" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/deviceID" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/deviceid" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/timeStart" value="now()" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/timeStart" type="xsd:dateTime"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/timeEnd" value="now()" event="xforms-revalidate"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/timeEnd" type="xsd:dateTime"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/username" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/username" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/userID" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/userid" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/instanceID" value="uuid()" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/appVersion" value="instance('commcaresession')/session/context/appversion" event="xforms-ready"/>
      <setvalue ref="/data/meta/drift" value="if(count(instance('commcaresession')/session/context/drift) = 1, instance('commcaresession')/session/context/drift, '')" event="xforms-revalidate"/>
      <orx:pollsensor event="xforms-ready" ref="/data/meta/location"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/location" type="geopoint"/>
    </model>
    <vellum:hashtags>{"#case/feedback_done":"instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id = instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/feedback_done"}</vellum:hashtags>
    <vellum:hashtagTransforms>{"prefixes":{"#case/":"instance('casedb')/casedb/case[@case_id = instance('commcaresession')/session/data/case_id]/"}}</vellum:hashtagTransforms>
  </h:head>
  <h:body>
    <group ref="/data/before_you_start" appearance="field-list">
      <label ref="jr:itext('before_you_start-label')"/>
      <trigger ref="/data/before_you_start/already_done_warning" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('before_you_start-already_done_warning-label')"/>
      </trigger>
      <trigger ref="/data/before_you_start/feedback_intro" appearance="minimal">
        <label ref="jr:itext('before_you_start-feedback_intro-label')"/>
      </trigger>
    </group>
    <input ref="/data/people_to_ask">
      <label ref="jr:itext('people_to_ask-label')"/>
    </input>
    <group ref="/data/participants">
      <label ref="jr:itext('participants-label')"/>
      <repeat nodeset="/data/participants" jr:count="/data/__nova_count_participants" jr:noAddRemove="true()">
        <group ref="/data/participants/consent" appearance="field-list">
          <label ref="jr:itext('participants-consent-label')"/>
          <trigger ref="/data/participants/consent/feedback_script" appearance="minimal">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-consent-feedback_script-label')"/>
          </trigger>
          <select1 ref="/data/participants/consent/feedback_consent">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-consent-feedback_consent-label')"/>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt0-label')"/>
              <value>yes</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt1-label')"/>
              <value>no</value>
            </item>
          </select1>
        </group>
        <group ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings" appearance="field-list">
          <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-label')"/>
          <select1 ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings/participant_gender">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-participant_gender-label')"/>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-participant_gender-opt0-label')"/>
              <value>female</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-participant_gender-opt1-label')"/>
              <value>male</value>
            </item>
          </select1>
          <select1 ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings/attended_last_meeting">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-label')"/>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt0-label')"/>
              <value>yes</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt1-label')"/>
              <value>no</value>
            </item>
          </select1>
          <select1 ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings/can_name_decision">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-label')"/>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-opt0-label')"/>
              <value>named</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-can_name_decision-opt1-label')"/>
              <value>could_not_name</value>
            </item>
          </select1>
          <input ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings/decision_named">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-decision_named-label')"/>
          </input>
          <select1 ref="/data/participants/about_the_meetings/spoke_this_month">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-spoke_this_month-label')"/>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt0-label')"/>
              <value>yes</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-attended_last_meeting-opt1-label')"/>
              <value>no</value>
            </item>
            <item>
              <label ref="jr:itext('participants-about_the_meetings-spoke_this_month-opt2-label')"/>
              <value>not_sure</value>
            </item>
          </select1>
        </group>
        <group ref="/data/participants/recommendation" appearance="field-list">
          <label ref="jr:itext('participants-recommendation-label')"/>
          <input ref="/data/participants/recommendation/nps">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-recommendation-nps-label')"/>
          </input>
          <input ref="/data/participants/recommendation/nps_probe">
            <label ref="jr:itext('participants-recommendation-nps_probe-label')"/>
          </input>
        </group>
      </repeat>
    </group>
    <trigger ref="/data/feedback_end" appearance="minimal">
      <label ref="jr:itext('feedback_end-label')"/>
    </trigger>
  </h:body>
</h:html>